    cost_detail: "Certificate experience requires purchase. Free Trial avaEnrolling in the course is free, which generally provides access to a 7-day free trial or an \"Audit\" mode where you can view all video lectures and readings at no cost. However, to unlock the 11 assignments and earn the official shareable certificate, a paid monthly subscription is required. Financial aid is also available.",
